  "question": {
    "text": "In the Kjeldahl's method for estimation of nitrogen present in a soil sample, ammonia evolved from 0.75 g of sample neutralized 10 mL of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>1M&nbsp;H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math> The percentage of nitrogen in the soil is<br />\r[Report your answer upto two decimal places]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "37.33",
  "solution": {
    "text": "In 0.75 g of sample the percentage of nitrogen can be find out as follows<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br />Here <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />% Nitrogen <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>0.75</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>37.33</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>",
